        "last_commit_message": "fix(cli): show the scanned files as the target of static scans (#314)\n\n`mcp-scanner static --tools FILE` never contacts a server, but its report\nlabelled the scan with the global --server-url default\n(https://mcp.deepwiki.com/mcp) as \"Scan Target\" / \"Server URL\", because\nthe label selection in main() had no branch for the static subcommand.\n\nLabel static scans as static:<files>, listing the --tools, --prompts and\n--resources paths that were scanned, in both the formatted-report and\n--detailed output paths.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
